{
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "branch-segment-guard",
  "kind": "vectors",
  "description": "The raw path segment the transport accepts for a branch: only what EncodeBranchSegment produces (an uppercase %2F, percent-encoded UTF-8); double encoding, dot segments, control characters, a literal slash and lowercase escapes are refused.",
